# A grating shorter than the beam truncates the Gaussian.
# Reference: numerical integration on a finer grid in NumPy.
title Gaussian-apodised grating 22 um long
grating angle=10 length=22
leak 1.0
apodise gaussian
expect radiated 0.99900000 1e-06
expect overlap 0.99996905 2e-05
expect efficiency 0.49948454 2e-05
expect position 11.00000000 0.005
